# SHA256 checksums for dataset archives
# Format: <sha256>  <filename>
# Fill in the hashes for the archives you download locally.
# Examples (replace with real values):
# abc123...  MH_01_easy.zip
# def456...  tum_vi_room1.tar
# ghi789...  tum_vi_magistrale1.tar
# jkl012...  recording_2021-05-10_19-15-19_imu_gnss.zip
# mno345...  recording_2021-05-10_19-15-19_stereo_images_distorted.zip
# pqr678...  recording_2021-05-10_19-15-19_reference_poses.zip
